{
    "version": "2.8.0",
    "description": "磁盘空间统计与清理工具（便携设置版：配置写入 WinDirStat.ini，不写注册表） | A disk usage statistics viewer and cleanup tool (portable-settings build: settings stored in WinDirStat.ini instead of registry)",
    "homepage": "https://windirstat.net",
    "license": "GPL-2.0-only",
    "url": "https://github.com/windirstat/windirstat/releases/download/release%2Fv2.8.0/WinDirStat.zip",
    "hash": "462d60796a793d333abeee79aa188debd444061a51f1abf8745340f902c3e047",
    "architecture": {
        "64bit": {
            "extract_dir": "x64"
        },
        "32bit": {
            "extract_dir": "x86"
        },
        "arm64": {
            "extract_dir": "arm64"
        }
    },
    "pre_install": [
        "# 便携模式开关：exe 旁存在 WinDirStat.ini 时，设置写入该 ini 而非注册表 HKCU\\Software\\WinDirStat。",
        "# 注意：persist 目标不存在时 Scoop 默认创建目录（见 install.ps1 persist_data 注释），",
        "# 因此必须在 pre_install 预建空 ini 占位文件（勿放 post_install）。",
        "if (!(Test-Path \"$persist_dir\\WinDirStat.ini\")) { New-Item \"$dir\\WinDirStat.ini\" -ItemType File | Out-Null }"
    ],
    "pre_uninstall": [
        "Stop-Process -Name 'WinDirStat' -Force -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue"
    ],
    "shortcuts": [
        [
            "WinDirStat.exe",
            "WinDirStat"
        ]
    ],
    "persist": [
        "WinDirStat.ini"
    ],
    "notes": [
        "已启用便携设置模式：全部配置保存在 WinDirStat.ini（persist），不写注册表。",
        "此前写入注册表（HKCU\\Software\\WinDirStat）的旧设置不会自动迁移。",
        "与 extras bucket 的 windirstat 同名，安装前请先 scoop uninstall windirstat（extras 版）。"
    ],
    "checkver": {
        "url": "https://github.com/windirstat/windirstat/releases",
        "regex": "release/v([\\d.]+)"
    },
    "autoupdate": {
        "url": "https://github.com/windirstat/windirstat/releases/download/release%2Fv$version/WinDirStat.zip",
        "hash": {
            "url": "$baseurl/WinDirStat-Hashes.txt",
            "find": "SHA256\\s+([a-fA-F0-9]{64})\\s+WinDirStat\\.zip"
        }
    }
}
